        "title": "Buttville: The Descent",
        "text": "Buttville is the last place in Earthworm Jim (Shiny Entertainment, 1994). It begins with a short maze of thorns that Jim crosses by spinning his head like a helicopter. Sega Retro calls it short but difficult. VGMPF credits this 1 minute 32 second tune to Mical Pedriana."
